Ghostty terminal engine
Desktop ships the unmodified libghostty-vt library pinned by the MyGo terminal
plugin. Provenance and the retained MIT notice are in
third_party_licenses/ghostty-terminal.md and third_party_licenses/ghostty-MIT.txt.

Offline conversation export
html2canvas, Apache ECharts, MathJax and Mermaid retain their licenses and
source checksums in internal/desktop/exporter/assets/.

Local decision inference
Sailry bundles unmodified official llama.cpp b11756 shared libraries and their ggml
runtime dependencies from https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp.
Pinned archive and member checksums are in
internal/localmodels/decision/llama-runtime.lock.json.
The original MIT license is retained in native/llama-LICENSE and provenance in
third_party_licenses/llama.md. The Windows OpenMP runtime retains its license
in third_party_licenses/llvm-OpenMP-LICENSE.

ONNX Runtime and sherpa-onnx
Local embedding, OCR and speech load the shared libraries pinned in
native/onnxruntime.lock.json. The ONNX Runtime MIT license is retained in
native/onnxruntime-LICENSE.

agent-desktop
-------------
The computer-use helper uses unmodified official agent-desktop v1.2.0 release
executables (Apache-2.0) from https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop,
built from commit 2b0a7334fc111730454b726e6800aa41cdafc093. Archive and member
checksums are recorded in native/agent-desktop.lock.json. Provenance is in
third_party_licenses/agent-desktop.md and the license text in
native/agent-desktop-LICENSE.
